  "idea": "Ollama: run powerful AI models completely free on your laptop",
  "text": "Stop paying twenty dollars a month for AI subscriptions if you only need local reasoning. Everyday summarizing and drafting tasks rarely justify sending sensitive documents to third-party cloud platforms. Centralized services also bring recurring subscription fees and surprise rate limits during high-stakes work deadlines. Instead, run Ollama to deploy open-source models like Mistral directly on your laptop. You eliminate monthly software bills while keeping data completely private.",
